      "quantity": 5,
      "description": "<p><strong>Activate</strong> <span class=\"action-glyph\">A</span> Strike</p>\n<hr />\n<p>Alchemist's fire is a combination of volatile liquids that ignite when exposed to air. Alchemist's fire deals 1d8 fire damage, 1 persistent fire damage, and 1 fire splash damage.</p>",
